'''Two As One''' (完全一心同体, ''Kanzen Isshin Dōtai'', '''Completely One-Hearted''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (M): Cat Cannon will charge 15 seconds faster.

